00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:21.480
Al Jazeera presents the incident alongside the prior warnings from the mining agency.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:26.900
This coverage draws attention to regulatory oversight in the mining sector.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:32.960
